  << /ActualText (The Playful Production Process reframes the pipeline as a creative game\054 embedding short \034sprint levels\054\035 cross\055discipline jam sessions\054 and self\055imposed constraints to spark invention\056 It champions rapid iteration\054 safe failure\054 and celebratory retrospectives\073 turning every milestone into a collaborative playground where teams learn fast\054 stay engaged\054 and unlock unexpected breakthroughs\056 \n\nA game\055inspired pipeline built on seven pillars\072\n\nExperimental Sandbox\nRapid Iteration Sprints\nCross\055Discipline Play Sessions\nConstraint\055Driven Challenges\nCollaborative Feedback Loops\nFail\055Fast \046 Celebrate Learning\nReflective Rituals\n\nWhat Works for UIW3D Studio\nSandbox Mindset\nEncourages students to experiment in Workshop without fear of grades \034breaking the schedule\056\035\nShort Sprints\n1\0232\055week strike\055team challenges slot neatly into our course rhythm\056\nCross\055Dept Play\nRole\055swap exercises reinforce empathy between Modelers\054 Animators\054 Programmers\054 and PMs\056\n\nWhat Doesn\031t Fit UIW3D Studio\nToo Much \034Chaos\035\nUnbounded sandbox exercises risk derailing milestone sign\055offs\054 especially when juggling two tracks \050film \053 game\051\056\nInformal Reviews\nSticky\055note jams are fun\054 but we should expect formal sprint demos throughout production\056\nFail\055Fast Culture \nCelebrating scrapped code\057art is great\054 but our limited semester timeframe means we can\031t always afford deep throwaway loops\056\n\n)
     /K [ 21 ]
     /P 1708 0 R
     /Pg 1665 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
