  << /ActualText (UIW3D Forums \050forums\056uiw3d\056com\051\nWe use the Forums every Semester to share\054 collaborate\054 archive\054 and run classes\056 \nOur work is forward facing at all times and is archived\054 however\054 some classes utilize Microsoft Teams alongside this\056 So it may not fully represent the content covered and\057or delivered in every class\056 \nThe Syllabus \046 Outline will be the source of truth for what\031s being taught in class and the projects\054 exercises\054 and deliverables for each class\056 \n\nCanvas\nOnly used to keep Grades\nWe keep a link that sends the students back to the Forums for the latest version of the Syllabus \046 Outline\056 \nWe do not submit work here\041  \n\nCurricular Map\nWe are working to redefine the Modeling program here in San Antonio\056 With the core faculty in place\054 we are working to iron out a unified voice in the Modeling concentration\056 It\031s be a bit disconnected and dated in past years\056 As volatile as our industry is and with the ever evolving landscape of technology and art\054 our goal is to remain agile while ensuring the students are anchored to a foundational core in Modeling that we hope to create\056 \n\n\n\n)
