  << /ActualText (Installed Python 3\0569\05613 via Powershell\n\nDownload\072\nInvoke\055WebRequest \140\015\n\055Uri \042https\072\057\057www\056python\056org\057ftp\057python\0573\0569\05613\057python\0553\0569\05613\055embed\055amd64\056zip\042 \140\015\n\055OutFile \042\044env\072USERPROFILE\134Downloads\134python39\056zip\042\n\nExtract it\072\n\044dest \075 \042\044env\072USERPROFILE\134Tools\134Python39\042\015\nNew\055Item \055ItemType Directory \055Force \055Path \044dest\015\nExpand\055Archive \055Path \042\044env\072USERPROFILE\134Downloads\134python39\056zip\042 \055DestinationPath \044dest\015\n\nYou Should have this now\072\nC\072\134Users\134thear\134Tools\134Python39\134python\056exe\015\n\nTell Poetry to use it\072\npoetry env use \042\044env\072USERPROFILE\134Tools\134Python39\134python\056exe\042\015\n\n\nPS C\072\134Program Files\134Ynput\134ayon\055launcher\076 poetry env info \055\055path\015\nC\072\134Program Files\134Ynput\134ayon\055launcher\134\056venv\015\nPS C\072\134Program Files\134Ynput\134ayon\055launcher\076 \046 \042C\072\134Program Files\134Ynput\134ayon\055launcher\134\056venv\134Scripts\134Activate\056ps1\042\015\n\050ayon\055py3\0569\051 PS C\072\134Program Files\134Ynput\134ayon\055launcher\076 \056\057tools\057manage\056ps1 build\n)
