  << /ActualText (\015\nmustafa\137jafarCommunity manager \057 Pipeline TD\015\n13 Jan\015\nHello\054 AYON is a modular system where you need to install addons to have more features\056\015\nTypically\054 a local AYON instance deployment is\072\015\nDeploy ayon\055docker locally\056\015\nLogin to your server and connect it to ynput cloud\056\015\nUpdate pipeline to latest release\056\015\nOnce you finish these setups\054 you\031ll have your AYON server with default configuration and then you can start creating a project and learning about the system\056\015\n\015\n\015\n\374\015\nmustafa\137jafarCommunity manager \057 Pipeline TD\015\n13 Jan\015\nwe introduced the Update pipeline to latest release to help users get started and configure their AYON instance easily\056\015\nConnecting your AYON instance to ynput cloud is free\056\015\n)
