3772 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Dear Hiring Team\054\n\nI\047m Carlos Garcia\054 and I am genuinely thrilled to apply for the 3D Designer role at MrBeast\056 With a diverse background spanning various facets of the 3D industry\054 including roles at Qualcomm\054 BioWare\054 and 343 Industries\054 where I contributed to projects like Star Wars\054 PUBG\054 and Halo Infinite\054 I bring a wealth of knowledge and experience to the table\056\n\nThroughout my tenure at these companies\054 I\047ve had the opportunity to lead teams\054 push creative boundaries\054 and contribute to high\055profile projects\056 My experience across different pillars of the 3D industry\054 including game development\054 feature animation\054 and technology\054 has honed my skills in various workflows and pipelines\056\n\nWhile my expertise primarily lies in game development and technology\054 it\047s important to note that I am a full\055stack 3D developer with a strong foundational knowledge of all aspects of development for both real\055time and pre\055rendered content\056 Despite being known as a 3D character artist in my public identity\054 I have a deep understanding and can execute at a high level in all subject matters in the realm of modeling\056\n\nAs someone who believes fervently in the power of new media\054 particularly platforms like YouTube\054 I was particularly excited to see MrBeast hiring a 3D artist\056 Traditional media is becoming a thing of the past\054 and I firmly believe that YouTube is not only the present but also the future of media\056 The ability to reach millions of people worldwide with engaging and impactful content is unprecedented\054 and I am eager to be a part of this movement\056\n\nI am a lifelong learner at heart and truly love a new challenge\056 The prospect of transitioning into a new space excites me\054 and I am enthusiastic about the opportunity to learn and grow alongside the talented individuals at MrBeast\056\n\nI believe that my skills and expertise can be effectively applied to this new space\054 and I am confident in my ability to make a meaningful contribution to the team\056 I am dedicated to excellence and have a passion for creativity\054 and I am eager to bring these qualities to the MrBeast family\056\n\nI am genuinely enthusiastic about the possibility of joining the MrBeast team and contributing to its innovative and impactful content\056 Thank you for considering my application\024I am eager to bring my passion for creativity and my dedication to excellence to the MrBeast family\056\n\nWarm regards\054\nCarlos Garcia)
     /K [ 1061 ]
     /P 3773 0 R
     /Pg 1665 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

