3785 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Dear Hiring Team\054\n\nI am excited to express my keen interest in the Destiny Senior Hard Surface Art Outsourcing Specialist position at Bungie\056 With a robust background in various pillars of the 3D industry\054 including roles at 343 Industries\054 BioWare\054 Qualcomm\054 and Walt Disney Animation Studios\054 I am eager to bring my expertise and leadership to your esteemed team\056\n\nWhile I have recently transitioned into education and thoroughly enjoy it\054 I remain committed to maintaining my presence in all pillars of the 3D industry as much as possible\056 My most recent tenure at 343 Industries this past summer reflects this commitment\054 as I had the pleasure to work in the Gameplay Model Shop on the armor team\054 producing armor for seasonal releases\056 Throughout this past year\054 I have also maintain practice and secured a recurring contract with the United States Air Force Academy\054 where I manage and built a small team to develop and support the entire Art Direction and Production for games built in Unity\056\n\nAt Qualcomm\054 I led and developed alongside our internal Character Art team and served as the focal point of contact for our outsourcers\054 overseeing the production of assets and ensuring alignment with project requirements\056 This experience has equipped me with strong communication skills and the ability to provide clear feedback to external art vendors at each stage of both 2D and 3D production\056\n\nFurthermore\054 my ability to take direction well and maintain positive relationships with internal teams and external vendors has been instrumental in delivering successful projects within tight deadlines\056 I am particularly excited about the prospect of standardizing naming conventions and file organization\054 as well as integrating assets with oversight on complex assets\024a challenge that I am eager to tackle head\055on and one that I\031m currently addressing within the academic setting\056 I recently conducted a pilot case study on the beneficial effects of Agile Methodologies in the classroom\056 By implementing a combination of SCRUM and Kanban frameworks\054 my aim was to alleviate burnout\054 stress\054 and anxiety among students\054 equipping them with practical time and project management skills to navigate both production challenges and personal obstacles effectively\056\n\nMy time in education has not only been utilized in the classroom but also in the development of a new unified pipeline in our department\056 Working closely with my Program Coordinator and Programming Faculty\054 I have worked to curate an industry\055standard pipeline in the academic setting\054 spearheading the documentation\054 integration\054 and use of a Unified Pipeline across disciplines\056 Additionally\054 as the lead of the Modeling Concentration\054 I have worked to onboard new adjunct instructors and full\055time faculty by fleshing out the onboarding process to facilitate a smoother transition into the classroom from the industry\056\n\nWhile my recent pivot to education has broadened my skill set and perspective\054 my passion for game development and my proven track record in hard surface art remain unwavering\056 I am confident that my combination of industry experience\054 leadership skills\054 and commitment to excellence make me an ideal candidate for this role\056\n\nThank you for considering my application\056 I am eager to discuss how my skills and experiences align with the needs of the role and contribute to the success of Bungie\056 I look forward to the opportunity to speak with you\056\n\n\nWarm regards\054\nCarlos Garcia)
     /K [ 1069 ]
     /P 3786 0 R
     /Pg 1665 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

