3813 0 obj
  << /ActualText (SHOT 1 \055 WIDE ESTABLISHING \nCamera\072 Static\054 centered\054 eye\055level\nFraming\072 Symmetrical down the hallway\nAction\072 Miles enters frame from screen right\054 walking with purpose\056 Stops at locker 214\054 mid\055frame\056\nPurpose\072 Establish control\054 isolation\054 and tone\056 \n\nSHOT 2 \055 MEDIUM OVER\055THE\055SHOULDER\n\nCamera\072 Back\055left angle\054 over Miles\031 right shoulder\nFraming\072 Locker in left third\054 Miles in center\nAction\072 Spins the lock\072 left\054 right\054 click\056 Locker creaks open\056\nPurpose\072 Begins ritual \055 confident and composed\056 \n\nSHOT 3 \023 INSERT\072 LOCKER INTERIOR CLOSE\055UP\nCamera\072 Inside locker looking out\nFraming\072 Miles\031 hands reaching inward\054 contents symmetrical\nAction\072 Adjusts folder\054 pencil\054 and checklist with precision\nPurpose\072 Visual metaphor for internal control\n\nSHOT 4 \023 MEDIUM FRONT PROFILE\nCamera\072 Static\054 across the hall\054 eye\055level\nFraming\072 Miles centered\073 locker open to camera left\nAction\072 He checks off the checklist\054 nods slightly\nPurpose\072 Shows ritual complete \024 visual stability\n\nSHOT 5 \023 CLOSE\055UP\072 LOCKER HANDLE\nCamera\072 Tight on hand\057handle\nFraming\072 Locker left edge\054 hand pulling\nAction\072 Pulls the door \024 it resists\056 Subtle tension builds\056\nPurpose\072 Introduces disruption\n\nSHOT 6 \023 MEDIUM FRONT\054 SLIGHT LOW ANGLE\nCamera\072 Static\054 low eye\055level\nFraming\072 Miles centered\nAction\072 Final tug \024 SNAP\041 \024 the door bursts open\nPurpose\072 Clean silhouette read\054 visual shift\n\nSHOT 7 \023 PROFILE WIDE SLO\055MO \050OPTIONAL FX\051\nCamera\072 Side view\054 profile of Miles and locker\nFraming\072 Miles left\054 locker right\nAction\072 Flashcards explode\054 sandwich flops\054 sock rolls\nPurpose\072 Heighten chaos and scale of the moment\n\nSHOT 8 \023 GROUND\055LEVEL WIDE\nCamera\072 Low angle from floor\054 facing locker\nFraming\072 Foreground clutter\054 Miles in BG\nAction\072 Miles drops to knees\054 collecting items frantically\nPurpose\072 Establishes physical vulnerability\n\nSHOT 9 \023 OVERHEAD TOP\055DOWN\nCamera\072 Directly above\nFraming\072 Miles surrounded by clutter\nAction\072 Frantic organization\073 visual clutter growing\nPurpose\072 Shows helplessness from abstract angle\n\nSHOT 10 \023 CLOSE\055UP\072 BENT FLASHCARD\nCamera\072 Insert\nFraming\072 Flashcard in hand\054 torn edge clear\nAction\072 Miles stares at the broken card\054 breath shortens\nPurpose\072 Symbol of the failed system\n\nSHOT 11 \023 INT\056 WHITEBOARD WORLD\nCamera\072 Virtual\057glitch space\nFraming\072 Centered glitch UI\nAction\072 Flowcharts flicker and shatter\073 \034ERROR\035 flashes\nPurpose\072 Internal collapse \024 stylized breakdown\n\nSHOT 12 \023 LOW SIDE PROFILE \050KNEELING PAUSE\051\nCamera\072 Low left\nFraming\072 Miles crouched\054 locker ajar behind\nAction\072 Sits still\056 Breathes\056 Hands release\nPurpose\072 Turning point of acceptance\n\nSHOT 13 \023 POV \057 INSERT\072 FOLDER\nCamera\072 Subjective POV\nFraming\072 Focused on one slightly wrinkled folder\nAction\072 Miles slowly picks it up\nPurpose\072 Choice to simplify and move on\n\nSHOT 14 \023 MEDIUM REAR THREE\055QUARTER\nCamera\072 Behind and left of Miles\nFraming\072 Locker slightly ajar in frame\nAction\072 Pushes locker closed\056 Doesn\031t latch\056 Leaves it\056\nPurpose\072 Metaphor for letting go\n\nSHOT 15 \023 WIDE TRACKING WALK\055AWAY\nCamera\072 Static or slow pan left\055to\055right\nFraming\072 Miles exits frame\073 locker recedes\nAction\072 Walks calmly\054 folder in hand\054 imperfect but composed\nPurpose\072 Resolution and growth\n\nSHOT 16 \023 STATIC WIDE ON LOCKER\nCamera\072 Locked shot on locker 214\nFraming\072 Centered\nAction\072 Flashcard flutters slightly\054 subtle sound bed\nPurpose\072 Emotional linger\054 metaphor hangs\n\nSHOT 17 \023 FADE TO BLACK\nSUPER\072 Before the Bell\nSFX\072 Soft bell \053 ambient hallway fade\nPurpose\072 Signature tone closure)
