3817 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The Outline\n\nOpening Shot \023 Early Morning Hallway\nMiles enters the hallway before anyone else\056 It\047s quiet\054 warm\055toned\054 serene\056 He walks with purpose\054 stopping in front of his locker\056\n\050He breathes in\056 This is his domain\056\n\nThe Ritual Begins\nMiles unlocks the locker using an exact sequence\072 spin left\054 right\054 click\056 The door swings open to reveal a meticulously arranged interior\072 color\055coded folders\054 a labeled pencil box\054 flashcards in tiers\054 and a laminated checklist taped inside the door\056\n\050 He begins his \034ritual\035\054 a highly specific arrangement\072\nAligns books by subject order\nStraightens each flashcard row\nRepeats a silent checklist\054 mouthing along with gestures\n\nHis world is perfect\056 Controlled\056\n\nDisruption\nHe goes to close the locker\056 It resists\056 He pulls\056 Jiggles\056 The lock sticks\056\050Suddenly\056\056\056CLUNK\041 \055 the entire locker bursts open violently\041\n\nContents spill across the hallway\072 flashcards flutter\054 a sandwich flops out of a container\054 a rolled sock \050\077\077\051 hits the ground\056\n\050Panic\056\n\nThe Spiral\nMiles drops to his knees\054 frantically gathering everything\056 He tries to put it all back in perfect order\072\nFlashcards back in sequence\nBooks stacked exactly\nSandwich container wiped clean\050But nothing fits right anymore\056 The folders are bent\056 A flashcard is wrinkled\056 His system is broken\056\n\nStudents start arriving in the background\056 He hears footsteps\054 voices\054 lockers slamming\056\n\050He freezes\054 hunched over the chaos\056\n\nThe Turning Point\nHe looks down at the mess\054 hands trembling\056 Then\046 he stops\056\n\050He takes a breath\056 Looks up\056\n\050His eyes land on one folder\073 today\031s class material\056 He grabs it\056\n\nResolution\nMiles stands\056 Leaves the rest\056\050\nHe gently pushes the locker closed\056 It doesn\031t shut all the way\056 That\031s okay\056\050\nHe walks down the hallway with his single folder\056 Disheveled\054 but calm\056\n\nFinal Shot\nThe locker remains slightly ajar\056 One flashcard sticks out at an odd angle\056\050\nFade to\072 \nBEFORE THE BELL)
     /K [ 1085 ]
     /P 3818 0 R
     /Pg 1665 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

