3819 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The Production Positives\n\nShort but Impactful\050A tightly scoped story with emotional clarity and visual charm\056 Ideal for practicing high\055end\054 character\055driven storytelling in a manageable runtime \050\1762 min\051\056\n\nContained Scope\050The short takes place in a single\054 repeatable location\072 one hallway\054 one locker\056 No camera moves beyond what supports character clarity\056 This keeps layout\054 lighting\054 and asset complexity focused\056\n\nNo Dialogue\054 All Visuals\050Designed for pure performance and clear visual communication\056 Every moment is told through facial acting\054 body language\054 timing\054 and sound design\056 No VO\054 no subtitles \055 just storytelling\056\n\nScalable IP Foundation\050Before the Bell is built to grow\056 This short is one of many stories we can tell about different students in the same school world all preparing\054 or not \055 before the bell\056\n\nQuality Over Quantity\050Fewer shots\054 more intention\056 Every frame matters\056 Focus is on clean polish and purposeful storytelling\054 not volume or spectacle\056)
     /K [ 1086 ]
     /P 3820 0 R
     /Pg 1665 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

