endobj

3821 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Shot 1 \055 Hallway Intro \055 Wide Establishing\nA Pixar\055style wide establishing shot of a quiet\054 sunlit middle school hallway in the early morning\056 The camera is centered\054 eye\055level\054 and perfectly symmetrical\054 evoking the visual balance of Wes Anderson but rendered with Pixar\031s warm\054 polished aesthetic\056 Rows of blue lockers line both sides of the hallway\054 with soft golden sunlight streaming in from high windows\054 casting long\054 gentle shadows across the tile floor\056 A 12\055year\055old boy \050Miles\051\054 wearing a neatly tucked school uniform and a backpack\054 enters the frame from the right\054 walking calmly toward the center locker\056 The hallway is empty\056 The atmosphere is peaceful\054 focused\054 and emotionally grounded\056\n\nShot 2 \055 Locker Unlock \055 Over\055the\055Shoulder\nA Pixar\055style over\055the\055shoulder shot of a 12\055year\055old boy \050Miles\051 standing in front of his locker in a warm\054 softly lit school hallway\056 The camera is positioned behind and slightly to the left of him\054 focused on his hand spinning the combination lock on locker 214\056 The boy wears a school uniform and backpack\054 and the frame includes the edge of the locker door and a row of lockers fading into the background\056 The mood is quiet and precise\054 with warm morning tones and subtle rim light along his shoulders\054 evoking Pixar\031s polished and emotionally rich visual style\056\n\nShot 3 \055 Locker Interior \055 Close\055Up\nA Pixar\055style close\055up from inside a middle school locker\054 looking outward toward a 12\055year\055old boy \050Miles\051 as he carefully adjusts the items inside\056 The camera is placed inside the locker\054 with the open door framing the shot from the sides\056 Visible in the foreground are color\055coded folders\054 a perfectly aligned pencil box\054 a laminated checklist taped to the inside door\054 and neatly stacked school supplies\056 Miles\031 hands are reaching into frame with precise movements\056 The lighting is soft and warm\054 with subtle bounce light reflecting off the glossy folders and metal walls\056 The tone is meticulous and serene\054 evoking Pixar\031s attention to detail and emotional nuance\056\n\nShot 4 \055 The Checklist \055 Front Medium Profile \nA Pixar\055style medium front shot of a 12\055year\055old boy \050Miles\051 standing in front of his open locker in a warm\054 softly lit school hallway\056 The camera faces him straight on from across the hallway at eye level\056 Miles is centered in frame\054 wearing a neat school uniform and a backpack\056 The open locker is to his left\054 revealing a laminated checklist taped inside the door and neatly arranged folders and supplies\056 He gently runs his finger down the checklist with focus and care\056 The lighting is soft and golden\054 casting subtle shadows across the floor and walls\056 The tone is calm\054 organized\054 and quietly confident \024 capturing the controlled start of his morning ritual in Pixar\031s stylized and emotionally resonant aesthetic\056\n\nShot 5 \055 First Resistance \055 Close\055up of Locker Handle\nA Pixar\055style close\055up shot of a 12\055year\055old boy\031s hand \050Miles\051 grasping and gently pulling on a metal locker handle\056 The camera is tight on the locker edge\054 focusing on the subtle motion as he tries to close it\056 The locker door is slightly ajar\054 and the tension is visible in the slight flex of his fingers\056 The background is softly blurred\054 with warm hallway lighting casting a faint reflection on the locker surface\056 The mood is precise and quiet\054 with a hint of resistance \024 this is the first sign that his perfect routine may not go as planned\056 Rendered in Pixar\031s stylized\054 detailed\054 and emotionally grounded visual style\056\n\nShot 6 \055 Locker Burst \055 The SNAP Moment\nA Pixar\055style medium shot of a 12\055year\055old boy \050Miles\051 standing in front of his locker at the exact moment the locker door bursts open\056 The camera faces him from the front\054 slightly below eye level\054 capturing the full action and expression\056 The metal door flies outward toward the edge of frame\054 while school supplies begin to spill \024 flashcards fluttering\054 a sandwich container popping open\054 a sock starting to roll forward\056 Miles\031 eyes are wide in shock\054 his shoulders raised in reaction\056 The hallway behind him is softly lit with warm morning tones\054 but the moment contrasts with sudden chaos\056 The tone is comedic and tense\054 capturing Pixar\031s blend of visual slapstick and emotional storytelling\056\n\nShot 7 \055 Slow\055Motion Flashcard Explosion\nA Pixar\055style wide profile shot of a middle school hallway showing a 12\055year\055old boy \050Miles\051 in dramatic slow motion as his locker bursts open and chaos erupts\056 The camera is positioned side\055on\054 showing Miles on the left third of the frame and the open locker on the right\056 Flashcards explode outward in a suspended arc\054 a sandwich container is mid\055flop in the air\054 and a single sock begins to roll toward the camera\056 Miles is caught mid\055reaction \024 arms slightly raised\054 eyes wide\056 The lighting is soft and golden\054 with warm tones illuminating floating papers\056 The tone is stylized comedy with emotional tension\054 rendered in Pixar\031s signature polished\054 character\055rich visual language\056\n\nShot 8 \055 The Scramble \055 Ground\055Level Wide\nA Pixar\055style ground\055level wide shot of a 12\055year\055old boy \050Miles\051 scrambling on the floor of a quiet school hallway after his locker has exploded open\056 The camera is positioned low to the ground\054 behind scattered flashcards and fallen school supplies in the foreground\056 Miles is kneeling in the mid\055ground\054 frantically reaching and crawling to collect the mess\056 His backpack is slightly off one shoulder\054 his hair is a little disheveled\054 and his movements are hurried and panicked\056 The lighting is warm but slightly shadowed now\054 with long early morning shadows stretching across the floor tiles\056 The tone is vulnerable and tense\054 highlighting emotional overwhelm through Pixar\031s detailed\054 expressive animation style\056\n\nShot 9 \055  Overhead Chaos \023 Top\055Down Scramble\nA Pixar\055style top\055down shot of a 12\055year\055old boy \050Miles\051 surrounded by scattered school supplies as he frantically tries to clean up the mess in front of his locker\056 The camera is directly overhead\054 showing flashcards\054 folders\054 a sock\054 and a sandwich container spread chaotically around him\056 Miles is crouched in the center of the composition\054 reaching in different directions\054 his body language stressed and disorganized\056 The lighting is slightly muted and neutral\054 casting soft shadows around the clutter\056 The tone is tense and visually messy\054 highlighting Miles\031 emotional spiral with Pixar\031s polished\054 expressive visual storytelling\056\n\nShot 10 \055 Flashcard Close\055Up \023 The Breaking Point\050A Pixar\055style close\055up of a bent flashcard held between the fingers of a 12\055year\055old boy \050Miles\051\054 shown from his perspective\056 The card is crumpled and torn at the corner\054 symbolizing his broken routine\056 His hands tremble slightly as he stares at it\056 The background is softly blurred\054 with fallen supplies faintly visible\056 Warm hallway lighting contrasts with the tension in the shot\056 The tone is quiet and intimate\054 portraying Miles\031 internal breakdown through small\054 tactile details in Pixar\031s emotionally rich visual style\056\n\nShot 11 \055 Whiteboard World \023 Mental Breakdown\050A Pixar\055style surreal inner mindscape of a 12\055year\055old boy \050Miles\051\054 visualizing his mental breakdown\056 Floating diagrams\054 whiteboard flowcharts\054 and labeled arrows begin to glitch and collapse midair\056 A large red \034SYSTEM ERROR\035 flashes in the center as visual overlays flicker and distort\056 The color palette is sterile and clean but digitally corrupted\056 Elements float and crash around him\054 with blueprints and data visuals scattering like paper\056 The tone is symbolic and expressive\054 evoking Pixar\031s blend of abstract storytelling and emotional clarity\056\n\nShot 12 \055 Low Side Profile \023 Kneeling Pause\050A Pixar\055style low\055angle side profile shot of a 12\055year\055old boy \050Miles\051 kneeling on the hallway floor next to his open locker\056 The camera is positioned slightly behind and to the left\054 capturing him in a moment of stillness after frantically trying to clean up\056 His hands rest on his knees\056 His eyes are closed\056 School supplies lie around him\056 The lighting is soft\054 with a gentle morning glow returning to the composition\056 The tone is calm\054 introspective\054 and emotionally grounded \024 capturing the turning point of the short\056\n\nShot 13 \055 POV Folder \023 Choosing Simplicity\050A Pixar\055style point\055of\055view shot from a 12\055year\055old boy \050Miles\051\054 looking down at a single\054 slightly wrinkled folder among the scattered mess\056 The folder glows softly in the morning light as Miles\031 hand slowly reaches into frame to pick it up\056 The rest of the clutter blurs around the edges\056 The tone is peaceful and decisive \024 a quiet emotional victory \024 rendered in Pixar\031s intimate\054 tactile style\056\n\nShot 14 \055 Rear \276 \023 Leaving the Locker Ajar\nA Pixar\055style rear three\055quarter shot of a 12\055year\055old boy \050Miles\051 standing in front of his locker\054 viewed slightly from behind and to the left\056 The locker is ajar\054 and Miles gently presses it closed\054 but it doesn\031t latch\056 He glances at it briefly\054 then turns to leave\056 The shot frames his backpack and body as he begins to walk away\056 Warm hallway lighting creates a soft rim light around him\056 The tone is gentle and reflective\054 showing acceptance in Pixar\031s quiet storytelling style\056\n\nShot 15 \055 Wide Tracking Walk\055Away\nA Pixar\055style wide side shot of a 12\055year\055old boy \050Miles\051 walking away down a school hallway\054 moving left to right across frame\056 The locker remains behind him in the background\054 still slightly open\056 Miles carries a single folder\056 His pace is calm and unhurried\054 his posture relaxed\056 The hallway is softly lit with golden morning light spilling across the floor tiles\056 The tone is peaceful and resolved\054 visually capturing personal growth with Pixar\031s cinematic polish\056\n\nShot 16 \055 Static Locker \023 Quiet Resolution\nA Pixar\055style static wide shot of a single locker \050number 214\051 in a quiet school hallway\056 The locker is slightly ajar\054 and one flashcard flutters gently at the edge\054 held in place by the door\056 The rest of the hallway is softly out of focus\056 There is no character present \024 only the space left behind\056 Warm early morning light spills across the floor\056 The tone is reflective and calm\054 evoking quiet closure in Pixar\031s signature emotional style\056\n\nShot 17 \055 Fade to Black \053 Title Card\nA Pixar\055style final frame \024 black screen with centered white title text\072 \034BEFORE THE BELL\056\035 A soft school bell rings in the background\056 The mood is gentle\054 final\054 and emotionally satisfying\054 signaling the close of a quiet personal story\056 Minimalist\054 elegant\054 and cinematic in Pixar\031s short film tradition\056\n\n)
